## Do not

- Ship a coverage table without screenshots when a staged build exists.
- Stop at canvas-only when the engagement needs a shareable PDF.
- Claim **Provided** for UI-only stubs that lack AuthZ / API backing.
- Pretend Partial photography/CRM/SSO items are complete.

